s, c'est si facile !\n\nPlus d'informations sur le service Filéo en cliquant ici.","kind":"information","severity":"INFORMATION","cause":"INFORMATION","updatedAt":"20250114T181151","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20161103T000000","end":"20301103T235900"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C02060"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C02067","status":"disrupted","disruptions":[{"id":"cb0d1739-25c5-44d0-8f80-ee21adec6d25","title":"4417, 4418, TàD Etampes - Changement ESTOUCHES","message":"Lignes 4417, 4418 et TàD Etampes.\nA partir du 1 Septembre 2026,\nl'arrêt \"Estouches\" est déplacé au 8 rue du Petit Villiers, 91660 Le Mérévillois.","kind":"incident","severity":"INFORMATION","cause":"PERTURBATION","updatedAt":"20260827T160024","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260901T000000","end":"20320731T230000"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C02067"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C02068","status":"disrupted","disruptions":[{"id":"cb0d1739-25c5-44d0-8f80-ee21adec6d25","title":"4417, 4418, TàD Etampes - Changement ESTOUCHES","message":"Lignes 4417, 4418 et TàD Etampes.\nA partir du 1 Septembre 2026,\nl'arrêt \"Estouches\" est déplacé au 8 rue du Petit Villiers, 91660 Le Mérévillois.","kind":"incident","severity":"INFORMATION","cause":"PERTURBATION","updatedAt":"20260827T160024","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260901T000000","end":"20320731T230000"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C02068"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C02069","status":"disrupted","disruptions":[{"id":"487e9c64-3d7e-41df-90a1-c0f636c91e6e","title":"2403 - courses non réalisées le 25/09/2026","message":"25/09/2026\nUn problème d'exploitation nous oblige à annuler les courses suivantes :\n- Coulommiers > Meaux : 16h37\n- Meaux > Coulommiers : 17h22\nVeuillez nous excusez pour la gêne occasionnée","kind":"incident","severity":"PERTURBEE","cause":"PERTURBATION","updatedAt":"20260924T171531","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260925T150000","end":"20260925T200000"}],"imp